# React Native's own packages are resolved by name from tooling that does not
# declare them — jest-expo reaches for @react-native/assets-registry, Metro for
# the community CLI — so they are hoisted where that tooling can see them.
# Everything else stays isolated, which is what keeps the API and the web app
# honest about their dependencies.
public-hoist-pattern[]=@react-native/*
public-hoist-pattern[]=react-native
